# Fixture: base definition with two labelled exceptions

```catala
declaration scope Exception:
  input high content boolean
  input low content boolean
  output amount content money

scope Exception:
  label base
  definition amount equals $100.00

  label higher
  exception base
  definition amount under condition high consequence equals $200.00

  label lower
  exception base
  definition amount under condition low consequence equals $50.00
```
